    notes: 
  - name: Starlight / ScalableLux
    author: RelativityMC
    category: 0
    licenseType: 4
    customLicenseText: 
    url: https://github.com/RelativityMC/ScalableLux
    usageDescription: Studied as a source of lighting optimization techniques - both its
      TECHNICAL_DETAILS.md write-up and the implementation behind it - after our own BFS
      flood-fill engine was already working.
    sourceFiles: []
    projectFiles: []
    version: 
    notes: Our light engine was built independently, then measured against Starlight to
      see which optimizations were worth adopting; the edge consistency check and the
      max(1, opacity) attenuation formula came from it. The shared BFS flood-fill core is
      convergence on the standard approach to voxel light propagation.
